{"repositoryId":1184689971,"availability":"available","full":"LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML","name":"SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML","description":"Hardware-agnostic machine learning infrastructure for .NET. Implements high-performance neural network layers in C# that are transpiled to run on WebGPU, CUDA, OpenCL, WebGL, CPU, and Wasm via SpawnDev.ILGPU. Optimized for Blazor WebAssembly and native GPU execution.","category":"Education","language":"C#","stars":21,"forks":4,"created":"2026-03-17T20:48:57Z","updated":"2026-10-15T13:18:43Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://lostbeard.github.io/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/","topics":["blazor","blazor-webassembly","coreml","cuda","distributed-computing","gguf","inference-engine","machine-learning","model-training","onnx","opencl","pytorch","safetensors","tensroflow","tflite","turboquant","webassembly","webgl","webgl2","webgpu"],"demo":"https://lostbeard.github.io/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.197Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.197Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.197Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.197Z","stars":21,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live Demo — interactive GPU demos: classification, style transfer, depth estimation, object detection, pose estimation, text generation, background removal, zero-shot CLIP, and more — running on your GPU in your browser, no server. (Which are verified vs WIP →)","Hardware-agnostic neural network inference + training for .NET — C# compute kernels that run on WebGPU, CUDA, OpenCL, WebGL, Wasm, and CPU via SpawnDev.ILGPU.","SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML implements neural network inference AND training as native GPU compute kernels written entirely in C#. Models run as compute shaders transpiled from C# — no ONNX Runtime, no JavaScript, no native binaries. The same code runs in the browser (Blazor WebAssembly) and on desktop. Drop in a model file — ONNX, TFLite, GGUF, or any of 7 inference formats — and run it on any of six backends. Train custom models directly on your GPU in the browser — no server, no Python, no CUDA install."],"features":["What actually works: Docs/DEMOANDMODELSTATUS.md is the source of truth — a per-demo VERIFIED / PARTIAL / WIP table with the test that proves each one. We mark stubs as WIP honestly, so a demo never lies to you.","System One decision heads (5.2.22+; Snake factory removed from package in 5.2.23) — typed choice / score / noul over a float state vector (Jev/Laya-inspired category, not a weight port). Tiny GPU MLP via TrainableModel,…","Demos - 15 VERIFIED end-to-end (most matched numerically against ONNX Runtime: classification, style, depth, detection, pose, face, CLIP, background-removal, super-res, text-gen, embeddings, sentiment, inspector,…","16 inference pipelines — Classification, StyleTransfer, SuperResolution, DepthEstimation, ObjectDetection, PoseEstimation, FaceDetection, TextClassification, ZeroShotClassification (CLIP), BackgroundRemoval,…","GPU training engine — Draw custom gestures, train a CNN classifier in real-time on your GPU, test instantly. Softmax-CE MLP training powers System One heads. Backpropagation, gradient descent, Adam optimizer — all in C#…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"01d8e39239662dfa80756d5ec5540c1e572fe44236ee3c6f6367815dbaff86a3","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.489Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:34.489Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live Demo — interactive GPU demos: classification, style transfer, depth estimation, object detection, pose estimation, text generation, background removal, zero-shot CLIP, and more — running on your GPU in your browser, no server. (Which are verified vs WIP →)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"01d8e39239662dfa80756d5ec5540c1e